message: >-
  Preview release (v0.1.0). If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "Low-Data Judgment (ldj)"
abstract: >-
  Tools to audit an AI decision system from a small random sample of human checks: certify how
  much work can be automated at a stated error or recall target, account for the whole workflow's
  cost, and measure when escalating to a fallback actually helps.
type: software
